    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d61">

                <pb facs="0175" n="143" xml:id="pg143"/>

                <head>61. Memorandum From the Executive Secretary of the Department of State
                    (Brubeck) to the President’s Special Assistant for National Security Affairs
                        (Bundy)<anchor n="0" xml:id="d61-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1963-03-25">March 25,
                    1963</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Implementation of Agreements Reached at San Jose</item>
                </list>
                <p>In response to the President’s written inquiry of March 22<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d61-f2"/> to Assist-ant Secretary Martin, there is enclosed an
                    initial report on measures being taken to implement agreements reached at San
                    Jose.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">D. Rowe</hi><anchor n="2" xml:id="d61-f3"
                        /></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d61-a1.xml" xpointer="d61-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
